How about a camping stove..?

Works much the same way as a tinning kit, but without the
intermediary of tins, going straight from corpse to prepared
food, cooking time based on the weight of the corpse.
Reduces chance of corpse being rotten/tainted but also
reduces the food value a little.
Stoves also have charges, (gas) which limit the number of
turns they can cook for.

Blessed,  Always perfectly prepared food, faster cooking.
Uncursed, Chance for under/over cooked food. (reduced food value)
Cursed,   Always under/over cooked, chance for gas cylinder to explode.

